2412	Prosopagnosia as a Manifestation of Neuro-COVID	Josef Finsterer	\N	2022-06-20		963	<jats:p>.</jats:p>	journal-article	0	10.47310/iarjacc.2022.v03i03.003	International Academic and Research Consortium	http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0	No publisher location	0	2709-1880	11	10	2709-1872		http://dx.doi.org/10.47310/iarjacc.2022.v03i03.003	\N
