nt of knowledge, its influence on policy and practice, and its recognition within the academic community.  It is indexed in leading international databases, ensuring wide visibility and accessibility to its content. The University of Mauritius Research Journal plays a significant role in promoting the University's research excellence and its commitment to advancing scholarship for the benefit of society. \n	24	1	1	5	\N
