ing cutting-edge research, fostering intellectual discourse, and disseminating vital information, the Journal de la Faculté de Médecine plays a crucial role in shaping the future of medicine. \n	1	2	1	2	\N
4	les cahiers du cread	nan	\N	https://www.ajol.info/index.php/cread, https://translate.google.com/translate?hl=sw&sl=en&u=https://www.ajol.info/index.php/cread&prev=search&pto=aue, https://revue.cread.dz/	f	\N	t	5	f	11	f	nan	f	\N	t	f	t	f	t	t	'Les Cahiers du CREaD' is a renowned academic journal dedicated to the multifaceted field of research and creation in the arts.  Published by the Centre de Recherche et d'Expérimentation en Arts et Design (CREaD) in France, the journal provides a platform for exploring the intersection of artistic practice, critical thinking, and theoretical inquiry.  Its scope encompasses a broad range of artistic disciplines, including music, visual arts, theatre, dance, literature, and film, encouraging interdisciplinary dialogue and cross-fertilization of ideas.\n\nThe journal's key themes revolve around the evolving relationship between artistic creation and research. It delves into the processes of artistic production, the critical analysis of works of art, the historical and social contexts that shape creative expression, and the role of technology in artistic practice. 'Les Cahiers du CREaD'  promotes a dynamic exchange between artists, researchers, and educators, fostering an environment of intellectual inquiry and artistic innovation.\n\nThe intended audience of 'Les Cahiers du CREaD' is diverse, encompassing artists, scholars, students, and practitioners engaged in the arts.  The journal seeks to reach individuals interested in the latest developments in artistic research, critical discourse, and pedagogical practices. It serves as a valuable resource for those seeking to deepen their understanding of the creative process, the complexities of artistic expression, and the evolving landscape of artistic production.\n\n'Les Cahiers du CREaD'  has established itself as a leading journal in the field of artistic research, contributing significantly to the ongoing discourse on contemporary art and its role in society. Its impact extends beyond the academic realm, influencing artistic practice, informing art education, and enriching public engagement with the arts. Through its rigorous peer-reviewed articles, insightful essays, and thought-provoking reviews, the journal fosters a dynamic and influential intellectual community dedicated to the advancement of artistic research and creation. \n	1	2	1	1	\N
