ledge and practices in tropical settings. By publishing original research articles, reviews, case reports, and editorials, 'Tropical Veterinarian' fosters innovation and facilitates the development of effective solutions to address pressing veterinary issues in tropical regions. The journal plays a crucial role in informing policy decisions, guiding research initiatives, and promoting sustainable practices in animal health and production in tropical environments. \n	7	1	1	1	\N
