ndustries. The journal aims to provide a platform for the dissemination of cutting-edge research findings and foster collaborations between researchers across the region and internationally.\n\nThe journal's impact extends beyond the publication of scientific articles. It actively engages with the scientific community by organizing conferences, workshops, and other outreach activities to promote the exchange of knowledge and foster collaboration. The journal also plays a crucial role in shaping the future of research and education in biophysical and computational sciences within East Africa, by providing a platform for young researchers to showcase their work and contributing to the development of a vibrant and innovative scientific community. \n	12	1	1	1	\N
