arch and innovation in the agricultural sector of Ethiopia and the region. The journal serves as a valuable resource for informing policy decisions, guiding agricultural practices, and advancing knowledge in various disciplines related to agricultural sciences. The journal's impact is evident in the citations it receives from other publications and the contributions it makes to the broader scientific discourse on agricultural development in East Africa. \n	12	1	1	4	\N
